WEBVTT

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.349
[laughing]
Yes! I did it! I...

00:00:10.872 --> 00:00:12.090
lost?

00:00:12.264 --> 00:00:14.005
How is that even possible?
I do not lose.

00:00:14.179 --> 00:00:16.138
I am also defeating you, hedgehog.

00:00:16.312 --> 00:00:18.880
Okay, okay, I get it, man.
No need to rub it in.

00:00:19.054 --> 00:00:22.971
Come on, Sonic!
Catch up! Yeah!

00:00:23.145 --> 00:00:25.495
Wait, what's going on?

00:00:25.669 --> 00:00:27.976
[yelps]
Why are you guys acting like...

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:30.848
holograms!

00:00:31.022 --> 00:00:32.459
Which means...

00:00:32.633 --> 00:00:35.679
I remain the undefeated
speed champion of all time!

00:00:35.853 --> 00:00:37.768
Yes!
And the crowd goes wild!

00:00:37.942 --> 00:00:39.640
But also, what's going on?

00:00:44.471 --> 00:00:46.603
[all] Surprise!

00:00:46.777 --> 00:00:49.214
But wait a sec, you guys...
[stammering]
...what is all this?

00:00:49.389 --> 00:00:51.826
"Happy Bea Arthur Day"?

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.872
Oh, it's
"Happy B-Earth-Day."

00:00:55.046 --> 00:00:57.179
Today's the anniversary of
the day you came to Earth, bud.

00:00:57.353 --> 00:00:59.137
It's your "Earth Day Birthday."

00:00:59.311 --> 00:01:01.009
So the race
was just a distraction,

00:01:01.183 --> 00:01:02.663
which I totally didn't fall for,
by the way--

00:01:02.837 --> 00:01:03.881
Good try, though--

00:01:04.055 --> 00:01:06.014
so you could throw a party
for me?

00:01:06.188 --> 00:01:08.364
Today, we honor you, hedgehog.

00:01:08.538 --> 00:01:11.541
If it wasn't for you, none of us
would be here right now.

00:01:11.715 --> 00:01:13.238
The boys are right, bud.

00:01:13.413 --> 00:01:14.718
You know, the day you came
to this planet

00:01:14.892 --> 00:01:16.459
is the day all our lives
changed forever.

00:01:16.633 --> 00:01:17.765
And we became a family.

00:01:17.939 --> 00:01:19.593
[barks]
You stole my hoomans.

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:23.118
You guys, I don't...
I don't know what to say.

00:01:23.292 --> 00:01:26.730
Except... let's party!

00:01:26.904 --> 00:01:28.819
[Tom] All right![Sonic] Yeah!

00:01:28.993 --> 00:01:31.909
[Knuckles] It's now on
till the break of dawn![Tails] Toga! Toga!

00:01:35.086 --> 00:01:37.872
Thanks for the surprise party.
It really means a lot to me.

00:01:38.046 --> 00:01:39.830
Ah, you deserve it, pal.

00:01:40.918 --> 00:01:43.443
[gasps] No way. Is that...

00:01:44.444 --> 00:01:46.184
What? [sighing] Dude...

00:01:46.358 --> 00:01:48.448
Could you just for once
walk at my speed?

00:01:53.496 --> 00:01:54.889
Whoa.

00:01:55.063 --> 00:01:56.630
[chuckling] Sonic!

00:01:56.804 --> 00:01:59.459
This is your--Yep. My old cave.

00:01:59.633 --> 00:02:02.897
Oh, man.
I can't believe this is where
you lived all those years.

00:02:03.071 --> 00:02:06.466
Hey! My state-of-the-art
security system!

00:02:07.031 --> 00:02:08.119
[kiais]

00:02:08.293 --> 00:02:10.165
[grunts] Still works.

00:02:10.339 --> 00:02:11.906
Hey, bud.

00:02:13.255 --> 00:02:14.474
What's this?

00:02:17.302 --> 00:02:21.176
Wow. You know, I drew that
on my first night on Earth.

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:23.352
I wanted to remember
where I came from.

00:02:25.615 --> 00:02:26.921
I still miss her.

00:02:28.357 --> 00:02:30.620
You think Longclaw
would be proud of me?

00:02:31.578 --> 00:02:33.318
I know she would, pal.

00:02:33.493 --> 00:02:36.539
Because even though you lost her
at such a young age,

00:02:36.713 --> 00:02:39.847
you didn't let your pain
change who you are...

00:02:40.717 --> 00:02:41.718
in here.

00:02:43.677 --> 00:02:45.505
Yeah. In my lungs.

00:02:47.071 --> 00:02:48.812
- Or your heart.
- Heart, right.

00:02:48.986 --> 00:02:50.597
Yeah, makes more sense.
Not lungs, heart.

00:02:50.771 --> 00:02:52.120
That's the thing
about life, Sonic,

00:02:52.294 --> 00:02:54.992
it's all about the choices
we make.

00:02:55.166 --> 00:02:56.646
You're gonna
make some good ones and,

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:59.257
knowing you,
you're gonna make some bad ones.

00:02:59.431 --> 00:03:00.432
But...

00:03:01.912 --> 00:03:04.480
as long as you remember
to listen to your heart,

00:03:04.654 --> 00:03:06.874
you're gonna
make the right choice
when it matters the most.

00:03:07.048 --> 00:03:08.615
Thanks.

00:03:08.789 --> 00:03:10.486
I don't know
what I'd do without you.

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:13.837
<i>I'd probably be
a totally different hedgehog.</i>

00:03:17.058 --> 00:03:19.016
[horn blares][grunts]

00:03:25.545 --> 00:03:27.024
2024?

00:03:27.198 --> 00:03:30.550
I've been trapped for 50 years?

00:03:31.725 --> 00:03:34.379
[people screaming][motors revving]

00:03:34.554 --> 00:03:36.556
- Move, move!
- Take positions!

00:03:37.731 --> 00:03:38.906
[tires squeal]

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:40.472
Get on the ground now!

00:03:41.822 --> 00:03:43.432
We've got you surrounded!

00:03:44.651 --> 00:03:48.568
Why won't you leave me alone?

00:03:48.742 --> 00:03:49.569
Take him down!

00:03:54.312 --> 00:03:57.141
I have dishonored
my marshmallow.

00:03:57.315 --> 00:04:00.884
It's really just a question
of temperature and distance.

00:04:01.058 --> 00:04:02.799
It's not a competition.

00:04:04.801 --> 00:04:05.715
This is so nice.

00:04:05.889 --> 00:04:08.326
- Peace.
- Quiet.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:09.632
Finally.

00:04:10.241 --> 00:04:11.547
Finally!

00:04:12.417 --> 00:04:13.984
[helicopter thrumming]

00:04:21.992 --> 00:04:25.561
Hey! We're trying to have
a family moment down here!

00:04:38.356 --> 00:04:40.707
- What did we do?
- Or what did they do?

00:04:40.881 --> 00:04:42.012
What did you do?

00:04:42.186 --> 00:04:43.710
I don't know.
I do a lot of stuff.

00:04:49.629 --> 00:04:51.543
Mr. and Mrs. Wachowski.

00:04:52.675 --> 00:04:53.589
Aliens.

00:04:53.763 --> 00:04:55.765
"Aliens"? Excuse me?

00:04:55.939 --> 00:04:57.288
It's not like we're
from different planet--

00:04:57.462 --> 00:04:59.421
Oh, yeah, we are.
I guess we are aliens.

00:04:59.595 --> 00:05:00.640
Please continue.

00:05:00.814 --> 00:05:01.902
I'm Director Rockwell.

00:05:02.076 --> 00:05:03.468
There is a very
dangerous situation

00:05:03.643 --> 00:05:05.862
unfolding right now
in Tokyo.

00:05:06.036 --> 00:05:10.040
Commander Walters
is requesting Team Sonic's
immediate assistance.

00:05:10.214 --> 00:05:12.695
"Team Sonic"?
Who picked that name?

00:05:12.869 --> 00:05:15.045
Love it!
Ten out of ten, no notes.

00:05:15.219 --> 00:05:17.526
Tom and Maddie,
put the s'mores on ice

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:21.443
because Team Sonic
is off to save the day!

00:05:28.232 --> 00:05:29.669
Remember,

00:05:29.843 --> 00:05:32.410
make good choices!

00:05:39.417 --> 00:05:41.811
["Neon"
by ONE OK ROCK playing]

00:05:45.902 --> 00:05:48.949
Good evening and welcome
to Tails Air flight 1012.

00:05:49.123 --> 00:05:51.908
We're looking at
an on-time arrival into Tokyo.

00:05:52.082 --> 00:05:54.171
Okay, Captain, we got
a rogue alien on the loose.

00:05:54.345 --> 00:05:55.869
How do we find him?[explosion booming]

00:05:58.132 --> 00:06:00.134
Uh, start with
the giant fireball?

00:06:00.308 --> 00:06:02.702
I love it! Let's start
with the giant fireball.

00:06:03.528 --> 00:06:05.269
[grunting]

00:06:05.443 --> 00:06:08.098
[cackles]
Finally, some action!

00:06:08.272 --> 00:06:10.144
Okay, time to gear up.

00:06:10.318 --> 00:06:13.974
Titanium handcuffs,
completely indestructible.

00:06:14.148 --> 00:06:16.150
I don't need
your silly gizmos, fox.

00:06:16.324 --> 00:06:18.239
And you know why?
Because I am...

00:06:18.413 --> 00:06:20.197
[all] ...one million
percent muscle.

00:06:20.371 --> 00:06:22.460
Yes, good.
You've been listening.

00:06:22.634 --> 00:06:24.680
[alert buzzes]
We're over the drop zone.

00:06:24.854 --> 00:06:27.335
All right, here we go.
Showtime!

00:06:29.946 --> 00:06:31.731
Now, look, we don't know
if it's Godzilla

00:06:31.905 --> 00:06:32.949
or Hello Kitty down there,

00:06:33.123 --> 00:06:34.734
but as long
as we stick together,

00:06:34.908 --> 00:06:36.561
there is nothing
we can't handle.

00:06:36.736 --> 00:06:38.433
"Team Sonic" on three.

00:06:38.607 --> 00:06:41.088
One, two, three.

00:06:41.262 --> 00:06:42.480
[all] Team...

00:06:42.654 --> 00:06:43.917
- Sonic!
- Knuckles!

00:06:44.091 --> 00:06:46.006
[groans]

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:49.618
Talk about low-budget flights.
No food or movies?

00:06:49.792 --> 00:06:51.359
We're out of here!

00:06:51.533 --> 00:06:53.578
["Neon" continues]

